    {
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "_key": "ministries-children-rooms",
      "heading": "Sunday, room by room",
      "body": [
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-h1",
          "style": "h3",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-h1s1",
              "text": "Sunday school",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-d-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-d-1s1",
              "text": "“Sunday School” refers to a time of small group Bible study during the hour before our regular worship service. While adults are in their traditional Sunday School classes the following is available:",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-e-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-e-1s1",
              "text": "Nursery (Rm. 104) is available for infants through 3 years old.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-e-2",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-e-2s1",
              "text": "Children Pre-K through 5th grade are invited to gather in the Kids Center (Rm. B01) to learn about Christian spiritual habits through creative exercises in art, music, reading.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-f-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-f-1s1",
              "text": "During this time, we emphasize one of four different spiritual habits: spending time with others, using your gifts, spending time with God, and witnessing to our faith.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-g-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-g-1s1",
              "text": "FBCM’s children’s ministry volunteers teach these spiritual habits through a variety of worship arts experiences, such as hand bells, choir, and theater.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-h-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-h-1s1",
              "text": "Parents can pick-up their children from the Nursery and Worship Arts Sunday School at 10:15 AM to enjoy breakfast at “Donut Hour” as a family in the Fellowship Hall.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-h2",
          "style": "h3",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-h2s1",
              "text": "Worship and children’s church",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-i-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-i-1s1",
              "text": "When it’s time for the worship service to begin at 10:45 AM, younger kids may be returned to the Nursery (Rm. 104) while older children Pre-K through 5th grade will join their families in the sanctuary for the first part of worship (~15 minutes) before being dismissed to Children’s Church.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-j-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-j-1s1",
              "text": "FBC Muncie provides childcare throughout all of worship for infants through 3 year olds in the Nursery (Rm. 104).",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-k-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-k-1s1",
              "text": "Families who prefer to keep their young children close during worship are also welcome to use the Family Room (Rm. 105) to nurse, calm crying kids, or take a break while watching the service on a TV.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-l-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-l-1s1",
              "text": "Because FBC Muncie believes that Children’s Ministry should be part of the life of the entire congregation, we welcome preschool through 5th grade children to participate in the first part of Sunday worship with the adults.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-m-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-m-1s1",
              "text": "During this time, children will be invited to join their families and the congregation in:",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-n-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-n-1s1",
              "text": "singing, clapping, and dancing to praise songs",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-n-2",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-n-2s1",
              "text": "reading and listening to holy Scripture",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-n-3",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-n-3s1",
              "text": "praying",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-n-4",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-n-4s1",
              "text": "participating in occasional “Children’s Time,” activities and lessons at the front of the sanctuary.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-o-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-o-1s1",
              "text": "When the first part of worship is over, a member of the FBC Muncie Leadership Team will invite all the children to line up and follow our Children’s Ministry volunteers to Children’s Church. You are also welcome to walk with your child to Children’s Church if that makes you or your child feel more comfortable. Currently, FBCM provides two Children’s Church classes:",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-p-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-p-1s1",
              "text": "Kickstart (Rm. 102) for Preschool through 2nd graders.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-p-2",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-p-2s1",
              "text": "The Underground (Rm. B01) for 3rd through 5th graders.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-q-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-q-1s1",
              "text": "During this second half of worship, adults will have the opportunity to hear the sermon and participate in the rest of worship.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-r-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-r-1s1",
              "text": "Meanwhile, during Children’s Church, your kids will be engaging with the Bible story through short stories, crafts, games, and other age-appropriate group activities.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-s-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-s-1s1",
              "text": "When worship is over, parents will take their security tag to pick-up their children from their various classrooms. If you are unsure where a classroom is located, you can stop by the Welcome Center and someone there will be able to guide you.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-h3",
          "style": "h3",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-h3s1",
              "text": "Through the year",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-t-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-t-1s1",
              "text": "Several children’s events are planned throughout the year. Some are just for fun while others are ways for the children to serve in the church or community. Events are age appropriate and fun for the whole family!",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-u-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-u-1s1",
              "text": "Examples of special events you can expect from our Children’s Ministry include:",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-v-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-v-1s1",
              "text": "Vacation Bible School (VBS)",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-v-2",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-v-2s1",
              "text": "Parent's Night Out",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-v-3",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-v-3s1",
              "text": "Family Service opportunities",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "ch-v-4",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ch-v-4s1",
